cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it and the underlying llama.cpp project."
title: "Beyond Perplexity: static mixed-precision KV cache for llama.cpp"
abstract: "Clean current-upstream implementation of static mixed-precision KV caching for llama.cpp. Adds the NU-Q2, Q3_0 and Q3_0_64 formats, a versioned per-layer KV cache policy interface, and CUDA support, reproducing the Beyond Perplexity paper operating points (Q4K-Q4V, Q4K-Q3V, C2)."
authors:
